  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th level, the envoy’s demeanor is hard to rattle, making it difficult to stir the emotions of him and those around him. The envoy is immune to anger, disorientation, and fear effects. All allies within 20 feet of the envoy gain a +4 morale bonus to saving throws against harmful emotion effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/envoy#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
